<title>FINLAND: ASKO'S UPONOR BUYS US FLOOR HEATING FIRM.</title>
<headline>ASKO'S UPONOR BUYS US FLOOR HEATING FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish plastic pipe  maker Uponor -- part of Asko Oy -- said on Friday it had acquired U.S. floor heating systems seller Radiant Technology which had net sales of $1.5 million in 1996 for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal signal's the U.S. market's increasing importance for Uponor,&quot; Uponor said in a statement.</p>
